    "detailed_description": "Break into the world of Dizzy Fight - choose your character - a beautiful thief girl, or an ugly zombie, an astronaut, or an office worker, or perhaps a medieval knight - and fight against opponents in picturesque locations. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach of the characters has their own superpower, such as launching a tyrannosaurus or a sports car at an opponent. Also, each character has their own combo techniques, but in order to use them, you need to score a certain number of points in a fight.<br />\r\nCurrently, two game modes are available - against the PC and playing with a friend on the same PC (controller is required for local multiplayer).<br />\r\nA dynamic setting, a fun atmosphere, and vivid emotions are what Dizzy Fight will give you.",
    "about_the_game": "Break into the world of Dizzy Fight - choose your character - a beautiful thief girl, or an ugly zombie, an astronaut, or an office worker, or perhaps a medieval knight - and fight against opponents in picturesque locations. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach of the characters has their own superpower, such as launching a tyrannosaurus or a sports car at an opponent. Also, each character has their own combo techniques, but in order to use them, you need to score a certain number of points in a fight.<br />\r\nCurrently, two game modes are available - against the PC and playing with a friend on the same PC (controller is required for local multiplayer).<br />\r\nA dynamic setting, a fun atmosphere, and vivid emotions are what Dizzy Fight will give you.",
